## Environment Configuration
- Never commit `.env` files
- Use `.env.example` for documentation
- Use config files for application settings
- Use environment variables for sensitive data
- Document required environment variables

## Queue & Jobs
- Use queues for time-consuming operations
- Implement proper job retry logic
- Use job batching for related operations
- Monitor queues using Laravel Horizon
- Handle job failures appropriately

## Caching Strategy
- Cache expensive queries
- Use cache tags for related data
- Implement cache invalidation strategies
- Use Redis for distributed caching
- Cache configuration in production

## API Development (if applicable)
- Use API resources for consistent responses
- Implement proper API versioning
- Use rate limiting
- Return appropriate HTTP status codes
- Document API endpoints
- Use API authentication (Sanctum)

